The **gibbon** is the smallest ape (lesser ape). The **nilgai** (blue bull) is Asia's largest **antelope**; the source keys it to the "deer" family. Hooves are found in horses, zebras, deer and cattle (ungulates), not in jackals, which belong to the dog family.

